==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*speḱ-}}
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:especial}}
From {{inh|en|enm|*special}}, {{m|enm|especial}}, {{m|enm|especiall}}, from {{der|en|fro|especial}} (whence also {{cog|fr|spécial}}), from {{der|en|la|speciālis}} (from {{m|la|speciēs}}). In this sense displaced native {{ncog|ang|synderlīċ}}.  {{doublet|en|especial}}.

